roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"Sun Yu","textMapHash":2626108194,"text":"But when it is me who's finally about to set out, I don't feel encouraged or inspired at all. All I want to do is to stay here for a little longer...","nextNodeIds":[210380205]},{"nodeId":210380205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"Sun Yu","textMapHash":3724154642,"text":"Traveler, do you think I can find what I'm looking for during this journey?","nextNodeIds":[210380206,210380208]},{"nodeId":210380206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2410828842,"text":"I don't know.","nextNodeIds":[210380207]},{"nodeId":210380207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"Sun Yu","textMapHash":1270380490,"text":"Hahaha... I mean, what am I even looking for? Do I even know it myself?","nextNodeIds":[210380210]},{"nodeId":210380210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"Sun Yu","textMapHash":770878786,"text":"Right, it's about time. I'm going to meet up with that merchant. Please, Traveler, take these as your reward.","nextNodeIds":[210380211]},{"nodeId":210380211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"Sun Yu","textMapHash":1770882954,"text":"Que'er... She's not here after all...","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":210380208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2244421834,"text":"It's all up to you.","nextNodeIds":[210380209]},{"nodeId":210380209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2400,"speakerName":"Sun Yu","textMapHash":2696475290,"text":"So... you are saying it's all up to fate.","nextNodeIds":[210380210]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2103802,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["2103801","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["41363"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_NOTIF